3.5 To request a Commercial License Agreement, contact the Licensor through
    the repository listed in Section 1.2.

3.6 Partnership principle. The Licensor enters into Commercial License
    Agreements only as partnerships between equals in which the Licensor
    participates in the economic benefit that the Software creates, for
    example through revenue sharing, equity, profit participation, or a
    joint venture. The Licensor does not grant flat-fee, one-time, or
    otherwise transactional commercial licenses, and no party may use the
    Software to generate revenue or to conduct or facilitate transactions
    unless the Licensor benefits financially under a Commercial License
