    out in that partner's Partner License File. The Partner License File
    is part of this License as it applies to that partner and controls
    over this Section 4 in the event of any conflict. Changes to a Partner
    License File take effect only when made or countersigned by the
    Licensor.

4.4 Commit rights. The Licensor grants each Designated Partner the right
    to commit to, and to nominate individuals to commit to, the Canonical
    Repository. Contributions made by a Designated Partner are subject to
    Section 6, so that the Software remains licensable as a whole under
