4.5 No sublicensing. A Designated Partner's rights do not extend to any
    third party, including the partner's affiliates unless its Partner
    License File says so. Where a Partner License File permits a Designated
    Partner to distribute the Software, recipients receive it under this
    License directly from the Licensor and have no rights beyond those this
    License grants them.

4.6 Term. A Designated Partner's rights under this Section 4 continue
    until varied or ended by a written agreement between the Licensor and
    that partner, or until the Licensor terminates them by written notice
    for a material breach that the partner has not cured within thirty
